$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 2-Amino-5-(furan-2-yl)-4-methoxy-7-(β-
D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine (10a). An argon-purged
mixture of 2-amino- 5-iodo-4-methoxy-7-(βH-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine 2829
(822 mg, 2 mmol), furan-2-boronic acid (336 mg, 3 mmol), Na2CO3 (636 mg,
6 mmol), Pd(OAc)2 (22 mg, 98 μmol), and TPPTS (142 mg, 0.25 mmol) in
water/MeCN (2:1, 10 mL) was stirred at 100 °C for 3 h. After cooling, the
mixture was neutralized using aq HCl (1 M) and evaporated to dryness in
vacuo, and the residue was purified by reverse phase HPFC (C-18, 0→ 100%
MeOH in water). Repurification by column chromatography (SiO2, 2.5% MeOH
in chloroform) furnished 10a which was crystallized from MeOH.
2-Amino-5-(furan-3-yl)-4-methoxy-7-(β
-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine (10b). Compound 10b was
prepared as described for 10a from 28 (844 mg, 2 mmol) and
furan-3-boronic acid as a yellowish solid (446 mg, 62%), which was
crystallized from MeOH. Mp 227-229 °C. [α ]D -49.7(c 0.376, DMSO). 1H NMR
(500 MHz, DMSO-d6): 3.51 (ddd, 1H, Jgem = 11.9 Hz, J5´ a,OH = 5.7 Hz, J5´
a,4´ = 4.4 Hz, H-5´a); 3.61 (ddd, 1H, Jgem = 11.9 Hz, J5´ b,OH = 5.5 Hz,
J5´ b,4´ = 4.3 Hz, H-5´b); 3.83 (td, 1H, J4´ ,5´a = J4´ ,5´b = 4.4 Hz,
J4´ ,3´ = 3.3 Hz, H-4´); 3.98 (s, 3H, CH3O); 4.06 (td, 1H, J3´ ,2´ =
J3´,OH = 4.9 Hz, J3´ ,4´ = 3.3 Hz, H-3'); 4.33 (td, 1H, J2´ ,1´ = J2´,OH
= 6.4 Hz, J2´ ,3´ = 5.2 Hz, H-2'); 5.02 (t, 1H, JOH,5´a = JOH,5´b = 5.6
Hz, OH-5´); 5.07 (d, 1H, JOH,3´ = 4.6 Hz, OH-3´); 5.27 (d, 1H, JOH,2´ =
6.3 Hz, OH-2´); 6.00 (d, 1H, J1´,2´ = 6.5 Hz, H-1'); 6.29 (s, 2H, NH2);
6.84 (dd, 1H, J4,5 = 1.8 Hz, J4,2 = 0.9 Hz, H-4-furyl); 7.41 (s, 1H,
H-6); 7.65 (t, 1H, J5,4 = J5,2 = 1.7 Hz, H-5-furyl); 8.01 (bdd, 1H, J2,5
= 1.6 Hz, J2,4 = 0.9 Hz, H-2-furyl). 13C NMR (125.7 MHz, DMSO-d6): 53.20
(CH3O); 61.93 (CH2-5´); 70.68 (CH-3'); 73.40 (CH-2'); 84.77 (CH-4´);
85.86 (CH-1´); 95.04 (C-4a); 107.48 (C-5); 110.04 (CH-4-furyl); 117.39
(C-6); 119.23 (C-3-furyl); 139.50 (CH-2-furyl); 143.16 (CH-5-furyl);
155.78 (C-7a); 159.68 (C-2); 163.29 (C-4). IR (ATR): ν 1625, 1602, 1572,
1444, 1228, 1126, 1077, 1059, 1029, 1000, 872, 782, 683 cm-1. MS (ESI)
m/z 363 (M+H), 385 (M+Na). HRMS (ESI) for C16H18N4O6Na [M+Na] calcd:
385.11186; found: 385.11172. Anal. (C16H18N4O6•0.3H2OH): C, H, N.
