$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 2-Amino-5-(furan-2-yl)-4-methoxy-7-(β-
D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine (10a). An argon-purged
mixture of 2-amino- 5-iodo-4-methoxy-7-(βH-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine 2829
(822 mg, 2 mmol), furan-2-boronic acid (336 mg, 3 mmol), Na2CO3 (636 mg,
6 mmol), Pd(OAc)2 (22 mg, 98 μmol), and TPPTS (142 mg, 0.25 mmol) in
water/MeCN (2:1, 10 mL) was stirred at 100 °C for 3 h. After cooling, the
mixture was neutralized using aq HCl (1 M) and evaporated to dryness in
vacuo, and the residue was purified by reverse phase HPFC (C-18, 0→ 100%
MeOH in water). Repurification by column chromatography (SiO2, 2.5% MeOH
in chloroform) furnished 10a which was crystallized from MeOH.
2-Amino-4-methoxy-7-(β
-D-ribofuranosyl)-5-(thiophen-2-yl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine (10c).
Compound 10c was prepared as described for 10a from 28 (844 mg, 2 mmol)
and thiophene-2-boronic acid as a creamy solid (441 mg, 58%), which was
crystallized from water/MeOH. Mp 197-198 °C. [α ]D -61.0 (c 0.280, DMSO).
1H NMR (500 MHz, DMSO-d6): 3.52 (dd, 1H, Jgem = 11.9 Hz, J5 ´a,4´ = 4.0
Hz, H-5´a); 3.60 (dd, 1H, Jgem = 11.9 Hz, J5´ b,4´ = 4.0 Hz, H-5´b); 3.84
(td, 1H, J4´ ,5´a = J4´ ,5´b = 4.0 Hz, J4´ ,3´ = 3.2 Hz, H-4´); 3.95 (s,
3H, CH3O); 4.07 (bdd, 1H, J3´ ,2´ = 5.0 Hz, J3´ ,4´ = 3.2 Hz, H-3'); 4.34
(m, 1H, H-2'); 4.98 - 5.13 (m, 2H, OH-3´,5´); 5.28 (bs, 1H, OH-2´); 6.02
(d, 1H, J1´ ,2´ = 6.5 Hz, H-1'); 6.36 (s, 2H, NH2); 7.05 (dd, 1H, J4,5 =
5.1 Hz, J4,3 3.5 Hz, H-4-thienyl); 7.36 (dd, 1H, J5,4 = 5.1 Hz, J5,3 =
1.2 Hz, H-5-thienyl); 7.38 (dd, 1H, J3,4 = 3.5 Hz, J3,5 = 1.2 Hz,
H-3-thienyl); 7.40 (s, 1H, H-6). 13C NMR (125.7 MHz, DMSO-d6): 53.14
(CH3O); 61.74 (CH2-5´); 70.70 (CH-3'); 73.62 (CH-2'); 84.91 (CH-4´);
85.92 (CH-1´); 94.97 (C-4a); 110.36 (C-5); 117.78 (CH-6); 123.68
(CH-5-thienyl); 125.03 (CH-3-thienyl); 127.68 (CH-4-thienyl); 136.83
(C-2-thienyl); 155.60 (C-7a); 159.71 (C-2); 163.36 (C-4). IR (ATR): ν
1613, 1576, 1478, 1449, 1302, 1120, 1072, 1045, 1006, 789, 695 cm-1. MS
(ESI) m/z 379 (M+H), 401 (M+Na). HRMS (ESI) for C16H18N4O5NaS [M+Na]
calcd: 401.08901; found: 401.08888. Anal. (C16H18N4O5S•0.65H2O): C, H, N.
