$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Step 2:
(R)-3-methyl-4-(1-methyl-6-(1H-pyrrolo[2,3-c]pyridin-4-yl)-1H-imidazo[4,5-c]pyridin-4-yl)morpholine.
(R)-4-(6-chloro-1-methyl-1H-imidazo[4,5-c]pyridin-4-yl)-3-methylmorpholine
(36 mg, 0.135 mmol), 1H-pyrrolo[2,3-c]pyridin-4-ylboronic acid (52.7 mg,
0.216 mmol), PdCl2(dppf).CH2Cl2 adduct (5.51 mg, 6.75 μmol), Na2CO3 (57.2
mg, 0.540 mmol), DME (1.2 ml) and H2O (0.6 ml) were mixed in a 2 mL
microwave vial and heated under microwave at 140 °C for 40 min. Another
equiv. of 1H-pyrrolo[2,3-c]pyridin-4-ylboronic acid and 0.05 equiv. of Pd
catalyst were added and the solution was heated under microwave at 140 °C
for 20 min. The solution was partitioned between EtOAc and water. The
aqueous layer was extracted three times with EtOAc. The organic layers
were combined, dried over Na2SO4 and concentrated. The residue was
purified on a prep HPLC. The product's TFA salt as a yellow solid (35.8
mg, 57% yield). LCMS (m/z): 349.4 [M+H]+, 0.45 min. 1H NMR (500 MHz,
DMSO-d6) δ 1.26 (d, J = 6.7 Hz, 3H), 3.30 - 3.48 (m, 1H), 3.54 - 3.64 (m,
1H), 3.76 (d, J = 2.2 Hz, 2H), 3.86 (s, 3H), 3.94 - 4.06 (m, 1H), 4.88
(d, J = 13.4 Hz, 1H), 5.53 (d, J = 7.1 Hz, 1H), 7.07 (dd, J = 3.0, 0.9
Hz, 1H), 7.50 (s, 1H), 7.70 (d, J = 3.0 Hz, 1H), 8.12 (s, 1H), 8.66 (s,
1H), 8.76 (d, J = 0.8 Hz, 1H), 11.74 (s, 1H). HRMS (ESI) m/z calculated
for C18H25N2O5 349.1763, found 349.1768.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM microwave irradiation, microwave vial used, Suzuki coupling, incremental
addition of PdCl2(dppf).CH2Cl2 and 1H-pyrrolo[2,3-c]pyridin-4-ylboronic
acid
