$DATUM 3-(4-Nitrophenyl)-1-(2-propen-1-yl)-4-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)-1H-pyrazole
(8b). In a sealed tube was combined
4-bromo-3-(4-nitrophenyl)-1-(2-propen-1-yl)-1H-pyrazole (7c, 5g, 16.22
mmol), potassium acetate (4.778 g, 48.69 mmol), bis(pinacolato)diboron
(4.532 g, 17.849 mmol), and
bis-(diphenylphosphino)palladium(II)dichloride (0.4555 g, 0.649 mmol),
followed by anhydrous 1,4-dioxane (160 mL). The reaction mixture was
purged with nitrogen and then stirred at 100°C for 18.75 h. The reaction
mixture was filtered through celite, concentrated in vacuo, and the
residue purified by reverse phase HPLC to provide the title compound (8b,
3.145 g, 55%).
3-(4-Nitrophenyl)-1-(2-propen-1-yl)-4-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)-1H-pyrazole
MS m/z 356.2 [M + H]+. 1H NMR (400 MHz, DMSO-d6) δ ppm 1.29 (12H, s),
4.86 (2H, d, J = 5.81 Hz), 5.15-5.31 (2H, m), 6.07 (1H, m), 8.09 (1H, s),
8.14-8.22 (2H, m), 8.23-8.32 (2H, m).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM sealed tube used
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Discovery of GSK1070916, a Potent and Selective Inhibitor of Aurora B/C
Kinase
