$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM N-(6-(5,6-Dimethoxypyridin-3-yl)benzo[d]thiazol-2-yl)acetamide 10 A
microwave tube equipped with a magnetic stir bar was charged with
N-(6-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)benzo[d]thiazol-2-yl)acetamide
27 (1.45 g, 4.56 mmol), 5-bromo-2,3-dimethoxypyridine (1.50 g, 6.88
mmol), Pd(PPh3)4 (300 mg, 0.260 mmol), KOAc (1.41 g, 14.4 mmol), DME (8
mL) and water (8 mL). The tube was capped and the mixture was subject to
30 min of microwave irradiation at 160 ºC. Water was added and the
mixture extracted with EtOAc twice. The combined organics were dried
(Na2SO4), filtered and concentrated. Purification by column
chromatography (elution with EtOAc/hexanes).
N-(6-(5,6-dimethoxypyridin-3-yl)benzo[d]thiazol-2-yl)acetamide 10 (746
mg, 50%) as a white solid. 1H NMR (300 MHz, DMSO-d 6): δ 12.36 (s, 1H),
8.31 (s, 1H), 8.05 (s, 1H), 7.80 (d, 1H), 7.76 (d, 1H), 7.61 (s, 1H),
3.92 (s, 3H), 3.91 (s, 3H), 2.22 (s, 3H); ESMS m/z 330.0 (M+ + 1); HRMS
found for M+ + 1, 330.0910, C16H15N3O3S requires 330.0907.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM microwave irradiation, microwave tube used, Suzuki coupling
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Structural Basis for Isoform Selectivity in a Class of Benzothiazole
Inhibitors of Phosphoinositide 3-Kinase γ
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Collier, Philip N.; Martinez-Botella, Gabriel; Cornebise, Mark; Cottrell,
Kevin M.; Doran, John D.; Griffith, James P.; Mahajan, Sudipta; Maltais,
Francois; Moody, Cameron S.; Huck, Emilie Porter; Wang, Tiansheng;
Aronov, Alex M.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Medicinal Chemistry (2015), 58(1), 517-521

