$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Only a small amount of desbromo product 6 was observed in the borylation.
Unfortunately, subsequent one-pot direct Suzuki coupling with 13 only
furnished 2,3-substituted indole 8 in 17% yield. The major product was 16
together with a very small amount of dimer 17.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM optimization study (ligand, base, time,temperature,stoichiometry,
catalyst), Suzuki coupling
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM A Highly Concise and Convergent Synthesis of HCV Polymerase Inhibitor
Deleobuvir (BI 207127): Application of a One-Pot Borylation-Suzuki
Coupling Reaction
